WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:03.840
Ever wonder what’s under SCP-049’s&nbsp;
Venetian plague doctor mask?&nbsp;

00:00:03.840 --> 00:00:07.600
Perhaps we should start calling&nbsp;
049 The Shy Guy instead of 096,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:07.600 --> 00:00:10.000
cause we’ve never seen this&nbsp;
guy’s face uncovered...hahaha.&nbsp;

00:00:10.640 --> 00:00:13.280
Maybe he’s just a furry and&nbsp;
his fursona is a goth bird.&nbsp;

00:00:13.280 --> 00:00:16.800
Maybe he’s got a terrible case of acne under&nbsp;
there that he’s really self-conscious about?..ha.

00:00:17.760 --> 00:00:22.080
Maybe he’s hoping to be invited to an Eyes Wide&nbsp;
Shut-style masked swingers party sometime soon,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:22.080 --> 00:00:25.360
and he’s dressing for the job he&nbsp;
wants rather than the one he has.

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:30.080
Maybe, underneath that mask, he’s Dr. Oz,&nbsp;
who’s been using his daytime TV show to help&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:30.080 --> 00:00:34.400
rid the world of The Pestilence for years.
Maybe, like the original Plague Doctors,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:34.400 --> 00:00:37.200
he wears it so that he doesn’t spread&nbsp;
or receive contaminants in the air.

00:00:39.040 --> 00:00:43.840
Uhmmm...Or maybe he just wears it&nbsp;
because under that mask, he’s butt ugly?&nbsp;

00:00:44.720 --> 00:00:50.000
Oh, what was that?
I see...Turns out, SCP-049’s mask is made out&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:50.000 --> 00:00:58.448
of bone and attached to his head. It is his face.
Yikes! HAHA Sorry, buddy! HAHAHA….AAHHHHHH!!

